{
    "id":  11713,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Surface Mount Circular LED Ceiling Light 15W | 4CCT | UGR19 | SMD2835 140Lm/W | CRI92",
    "reference":  "PLSRUGR15W-4CCT-91461",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eIlluminate your spaces with style and efficiency with the \u003cstrong\u003eCircular Surface LED Ceiling Light 15W GXtronic Driver\u003c/strong\u003e. Its \u003cstrong\u003eultra-thin design of just 26mm\u003c/strong\u003e provides a modern and elegant finish, while the \u003cstrong\u003e4CCT selectable technology (2700K/3000K/4000K/5700K)\u003c/strong\u003e allows customizing the white light tone for each environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith \u003cstrong\u003e140Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e high brightness and \u003cstrong\u003eCRI\u0026gt;92\u003c/strong\u003e, enjoy clear, sharp, natural light. Made of aluminum with \u003cstrong\u003eUGR\u0026lt;19 microprism diffuser\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eCircular Surface LED Ceiling Light 15W | 4CCT | UGR19 |SMD2835 140Lm/W | CRI92\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e15W Circular Surface LED Ceiling Light\u003c/strong\u003e combines \u003cstrong\u003eenergy efficiency, modern design, light quality and a high-performance GXtronic Driver\u003c/strong\u003e, making it a modern, efficient and versatile lighting solution designed to deliver maximum visual comfort and elegant styling in any space. With an \u003cstrong\u003eultra-slim design of just 26mm in height\u003c/strong\u003e, it integrates discreetly into ceilings of up to 3 metres, giving a clean, minimalist appearance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts advanced \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 4CCT technology (2700K/3000K/4000K/5700K)\u003c/strong\u003e allows you to choose between different colour temperatures according to need: from a warm, welcoming light for residential settings, to neutral or cool lighting for professional and commercial spaces. Thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003eefficiency of 140Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003eCRI\u0026gt;92\u003c/strong\u003e, it offers excellent colour rendering and clear, even brightness that enhances colours and improves the perception of the surroundings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eManufactured from \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-quality aluminium\u003c/strong\u003e, with a \u003cstrong\u003emicro-prismatic diffuser UGR\u0026lt;19\u003c/strong\u003e, this ceiling light reduces glare and guarantees optimal visual comfort, meeting the standards required in places where prolonged lighting is essential.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRecommended applications for the 15W 4CCT UGR19 Circular Surface Ceiling Light:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHomes:\u003c/strong\u003e perfect for living rooms, hallways, bedrooms and kitchens, bringing a modern design and light that adapts to every moment of the day.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOffices and workspaces:\u003c/strong\u003e ensures uniform lighting that reduces visual fatigue, ideal for working environments requiring concentration and comfort.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShops and retail:\u003c/strong\u003e highlights products and spaces with high-quality light that improves the customer experience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHospitality and hotels:\u003c/strong\u003e provides elegant, efficient lighting in receptions, corridors, dining rooms or bedrooms.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEducational and healthcare centres:\u003c/strong\u003e thanks to its low glare index and luminous clarity, it is especially suited to classrooms, waiting rooms and consulting rooms.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn short, the \u003cstrong\u003e15W Circular Surface LED Ceiling Light\u003c/strong\u003e combines \u003cstrong\u003eenergy efficiency, modern design and light quality\u003c/strong\u003e, making it the ideal choice for residential, commercial and professional projects seeking reliable, attractive and comfortable lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide every element required for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical datasheet for each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
